## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Client: Tommy Reynolds
Site: Personal brand + coaching landing pages
Core Line: "I build the protocol. You just clock in."
Status: Active build — implementing new copy

## THE BRAND

Tommy is a fitness authority (20 years, 8 gyms, $20M) who helps:
1. TRAINERS build profitable businesses → "The Wealth Protocol"
2. EXECUTIVES build sustainable fitness → "The Executive Protocol"

The positioning: System over motivation. Protocol over willpower.
The feeling: Relief. Not hype. "Finally, someone just tells me what to do."

## SITE STRUCTURE

```
Homepage (/)
├── Hero: "I build the protocol. You just clock in."
├── The Gap: "Exceptional at one thing, falling apart at another"
├── Story teaser: 2008
├── The Fork: [Your Business] [Your Body]
└── CTA

/story — Full narrative (3 chapters)
/business — The Wealth Protocol (for trainers)
/body — The Executive Protocol (for executives)
```

NAV: [My Story] [Your Business] [Your Body] ... [Let's Talk]

## VISUAL SYSTEM

```
Colors (from index.css):
- Primary (Warm Stone): #2C2825
- Background (Bone): #F5F2ED  
- Accent (Ember): #D4572A — CTAs and highlights only
- Text (Charcoal): #1A1815
- Secondary (Sand): #E8E0D5

Typography:
- Headlines: Playfair Display (serif)
- Body: Inter (sans-serif)
- All corners: border-radius: 0 (sharp)

Signature element: The Period
- Accent-colored period at end of headlines
- Class: .signature-period or <span className="text-accent">.</span>
```

