## RULES

1. READ SITE-COPY-FINAL.md before making changes
2. Match copy EXACTLY — it's been through deep research
3. Keep the visual system consistent (colors, fonts, sharp corners)
4. The accent color (Ember) is for CTAs and periods ONLY
5. No decorative gimmicks — the edge is in the copy
6. Everything funnels to Calendly (Let's Talk)
7. Mobile-first — must work flawlessly on phone

## DO NOT

- Add animated text sequences or techy overlays
- Change the core line without discussion
- Put pricing on the site
- Use rounded corners anywhere
- Overuse the accent color
- Add features not in the copy doc

## THE JOB

Make people believe Tommy is the real deal.
Get them to book a call.
That's it.
